      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this issue, Alvin King, Daniele Piomelli, and colleagues publish another interesting paper on inhibition of monoacylglycerol lipase (MGL). MGL is a hot target for antinociceptive agents, being the chief degrading enzyme of the endocannabinoid 2-arachidonoylglycerol."},
